<title>USA: Tosco sets $600 mln in three-tranche deal.</title>
<headline>Tosco sets $600 mln in three-tranche deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following three-tranche debt issue from Tosco Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER TOSCO CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 01/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.681  FIRST PAY DATE 07/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.295 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 72 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.80 PCT   MATURITY 01/01/2027</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 99.888  FIRST PAY DATE 07/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.81 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 94 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.90 PCT   MATURITY 01/01/2047</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 07/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.90 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
